      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The enhanced ductility arises because multiple deformation mechanisms operate synergistically.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "As-fabricated CoNiCrFeMn HEA nanowires have an FCC-dominated structure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanowires can be subjected to tensile deformation from cryogenic through elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant conditions are controlled strain-rate tensile tests at cryogenic and room temperatures.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deformation twinning is activated in the CoNiCrFeMn nanowires.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An FCC-to-HCP phase transformation is activated simultaneously with twinning.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cross-sectional reorientation accompanies twinning and phase transformation in the HEA nanowires.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Synergistic twinning-induced and transformation-induced plasticity accommodates large strains.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed deformation mechanisms prevent premature dislocation pile-up.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed deformation mechanisms prevent premature crack formation and thereby promote ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "CoNiCrFeMn HEA nanowires exhibit high strain-to-failure.",
